t-neo-display text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-neo-cream text-balance tv:text-2xl">Your words land here</p><p dir="auto" class="max-w-[17rem] text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-neo-cream/60 text-balance tv:text-lg">Drag across the letters or just type. Every word stacks up here, newest on top.</p></div><div data-testid="shell-words-ladder" class="shrink-0 border-t-2 border-black/40 px-3 pb-3 pt-2"><p class="mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-neo-cream/60 tv:text-base">By length</p><div dir="ltr" class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2"><div data-testid="shell-ladder-3" data-len="3" data-count="0" data-fresh="false" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="font-neo-display text-sm font-black tabular-nums tv:text-xl text-neo-cream/30">0</span><div class="relative h-12 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border-2 border-black bg-black/30 tv:h-20"><div class="ladderFill absolute inset-0 rounded-[3px] bg-neo-cream/35" style="--ladder: 0;"></div></div><span class="font-neo-display text-xs font-bold text-neo-cream/60 tv:text-base">3</span></div><div data-testid="shell-ladder-4" data-len="4" data-count="0" data-fresh="false" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="font-neo-display text-sm font-black tabular-nums tv:text-xl text-neo-cream/30">0</span><div class="relative h-12 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border-2 border-black bg-black/30 tv:h-20"><div class="ladderFill absolute inset-0 rounded-[3px] bg-neo-cream/35" style="--ladder: 0;"></div></div><span class="font-neo-display text-xs font-bold text-neo-cream/60 tv:text-base">4</span></div><div data-testid="shell-ladder-5" data-len="5" data-count="0" data-fresh="false" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="font-neo-display text-sm font-black tabular-nums tv:text-xl text-neo-cream/30">0</span><div class="relative h-12 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border-2 border-black bg-black/30 tv:h-20"><div class="ladderFill absolute inset-0 rounded-[3px